# The realtime service is NOT deployed to Vercel — it holds long-lived
# WebSockets and per-room state, which a serverless function cannot. It has its
# own Dockerfile and goes to a container host (see docs/DEPLOY.md).
#
# Excluded from the upload so a realtime-only change does not invalidate the
# Vercel build cache, and so its dev-only scripts never reach the platform.
apps/realtime/scripts
apps/realtime/src/__integration__

# Local state and test artefacts.
**/.next
**/node_modules
**/.turbo
